{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜美收緊AI芯片出口 五國採購須領牌 英偉達股價挫逾4%           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">美國商務部周一公布臨時規則，企業向新加坡、馬來西亞、印尼、泰國及巴西出口、再出口或在當地轉移內置英偉達等美企先進AI芯片的設備前，須先向華府申領許可證，以堵塞中國等對手藉境外數據中心遙距取用美國算力的漏洞。消息拖累英偉達股價跌逾4%，費城半導體指數挫逾5%。新加坡表示正研究新規細節並與美方溝通，巴西稱暫難評估影響。商務部罕有指出，規則由財政部及國家安全委員會主導制訂。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T02:46:51.051741+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T01:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T02:40:29.900116+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T02:40:29.900116+00:00","content_hash":"b4634f047c4f1b12f6004f519b3c0e222d696d0b267578203907abe3ec7703dd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}